The '''{{zone|Shepherd's Keep}}''' is a location in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}, [[The Farming Islands]].

{{ZoneText|Talk to the Shepherd.}}

== Purpose ==
The {{zone|Shepherd's Keep}} is a section in the south-east of the Mushroom Desert. It contains {{MobSprite|Sheep}}, a reduced amount of {{Item|Cactus|text=Cacti}} and a small house with the {{NPCSprite|Shepherd}} in it.

